            "detailed_description": "Tu és a única esperança de Quinn, após este acordar sozinho num quarto trancado que apenas possui um computador ligado a um chat da Internet. As tuas escolhas (e prontidão) ditarão as probabilidades da sua fuga... ou levá-lo-ão a uma morte prematura.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/624f9dfa6a282fdce7d227f76b61986e.webp?t=1778413158\" width=336 height=41 /></span><br>STAY é jogado em tempo real, o que significa que cada minuto que passes longe do jogo, é um minuto que Quinn passa sozinho. Abandonar diálogos ou deixar o Quinn a sós durante muito tempo terá as suas consequências.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/3dc0b6da87c35700401d96bb128f902f.apng?t=1778413158\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/3dc0b6da87c35700401d96bb128f902f.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=144 /></picture></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/a5f2f5c50eeb2affc113bd25cd64b52b.webp?t=1778413158\" width=393 height=35 /></span><br>O Quinn tem os nervos em franja, por isso cuidado com o que dizes. Demonstra a tua compaixão para ganhar a sua confiança e ficar a par das suas descobertas e pensamentos mais profundos. Se não o fizeres, as suas emoções poderão virar-se contra ti.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/55d268de8af63dfb2b89d7daee777229.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/55d268de8af63dfb2b89d7daee777229.webm?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/55d268de8af63dfb2b89d7daee777229.mp4?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/3ab8a502b57a436a0bb3f7007c093b28.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/3ab8a502b57a436a0bb3f7007c093b28.webm?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/c27a7c8a27e2089d3f8b40987b9cde20.webp?t=1778413158\" width=350 height=35 /></span><br>STAY foi concebido para ser jogado várias vezes e conta com 24 capítulos, sete finais distintos, dezenas de maneiras de morrer e ramificações de diálogos cheias de opções. Explora quartos distintos e desvenda os mistérios ao concluir o jogo diversas vezes para ficar a conhecer toda a narrativa.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/325bab0c9d8bef6a0fb0b665c3b15a97.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/325bab0c9d8bef6a0fb0b665c3b15a97.webm?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/325bab0c9d8bef6a0fb0b665c3b15a97.mp4?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/472b9f08ce34b1cb06ce10c585a27010.webp?t=1778413158\" width=350 height=35 /></span><br>As webcams permitem-te espiar o Quinn para ver as suas reações aos teus comentários e as suas ações quando te afastas do computador. Descobre as suas mentiras e aproveita-te delas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/ebe45d6445e6bd480bf1dc1fee8826c1.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=400 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/7b9ebae1ad8e00b93be53cfeb109afe3.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/7b9ebae1ad8e00b93be53cfeb109afe3.webm?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/7b9ebae1ad8e00b93be53cfeb109afe3.mp4?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/62aa6d12fe9c1a9f89f816f469e17aab.webp?t=1778413158\" width=547 height=35 /></span><br>Entra na pele de Quinn e assume o controlo das suas ações durante as secções de enigmas para ajudá-lo a resolver os problemas mais desafiantes que encontrar na prisão.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/90f9e55d546217ba761f97a98b4c3093.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/90f9e55d546217ba761f97a98b4c3093.webm?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st