as/472b9f08ce34b1cb06ce10c585a27010.webp?t=1778413158\" width=350 height=35 /></span><br>As webcams permitem-te espiar o Quinn para ver as suas reações aos teus comentários e as suas ações quando te afastas do computador. Descobre as suas mentiras e aproveita-te delas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/ebe45d6445e6bd480bf1dc1fee8826c1.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=400 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/7b9ebae1ad8e00b93be53cfeb109afe3.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/7b9ebae1ad8e00b93be53cfeb109afe3.webm?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/7b9ebae1ad8e00b93be53cfeb109afe3.mp4?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/62aa6d12fe9c1a9f89f816f469e17aab.webp?t=1778413158\" width=547 height=35 /></span><br>Entra na pele de Quinn e assume o controlo das suas ações durante as secções de enigmas para ajudá-lo a resolver os problemas mais desafiantes que encontrar na prisão.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/90f9e55d546217ba761f97a98b4c3093.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/90f9e55d546217ba761f97a98b4c3093.webm?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/90f9e55d546217ba761f97a98b4c3093.mp4?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/0eb992efc115887339c9ec9ff00d73e4.poster.avif?t=1778413158\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/0eb992efc115887339c9ec9ff00d73e4.webm?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/753230/extras/0eb992efc115887339c9ec9ff00d73e4.mp4?t=1778413158\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
